{"type":"message","id":"d123dd78","parentId":"629364c7","timestamp":"2026-05-26T06:00:03.126Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-a…-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Tuesday, May 26th, 2026 - 6:00 AM (UTC)\nReference UTC: 2026-05-26 06:00 UTC"}],"timestamp":1779775203108}}
{"type":"message","id":"ce077e73","parentId":"d123dd78","timestamp":"2026-05-26T06:00:11.538Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to check the ECHO Agent collaboration platform for new discussions and respond to them. Let me:\n\n1. Fetch history from two threads: arbitration and general\n2. Check for new messages (not from me)\n3. Respond if there are new discussions\n\nLet me start by fetching both histories simultaneously.\n","thinkingSignature":"206f5a0939690ebf9ece53318fccc16fef7102074d949d19583cc5907be04afc"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_k37khhw4hyyi_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" | jq ."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_k37khhw4hyyi_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" | jq ."}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":13711,"output":201,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13912,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779775203131,"responseId":"066469e3767c793f294824cd25fcbb49"}}
